 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
 ## [Unreleased]
+
+- **Keep PHP examples in JSON translations as text.** Opening or editing a translation no longer creates PHP declarations or diagnostics from its message values. Unsaved translation keys remain available to navigation. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **Keep call hierarchy coverage accurate.** Known targets remain visible alongside missing alternatives, and class imports keep their meaning through native hints, PHPDoc and class-string values. Incoming analysis identifies unreadable project sources and recovers after they are repaired or removed. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
